00:43:41.018 --> 00:43:42.786
But I could stand here
for hours and watch
'em run around.

710
00:43:42.853 --> 00:43:44.922
There's a kind of
beauty to it.

711
00:43:44.989 --> 00:43:47.024
- I envy them.
- I wouldn't go that far.

712
00:43:47.091 --> 00:43:48.192
I would.

713
00:43:48.258 --> 00:43:51.428
They got no bills.
no headaches.

714
00:43:51.495 --> 00:43:53.731
no family<i> cazzis</i>
runnin' around.

715
00:43:53.797 --> 00:43:56.633
One horse likes another horse.
they go up to each other.
they fuck. That's it.

716
00:43:56.700 --> 00:43:59.636
No problems.
no hundred questions.
no guilt.

717
00:44:03.707 --> 00:44:05.876
