723
00:44:18.722 --> 00:44:21.225
You know.
it makes me feel terrible.

724
00:44:24.395 --> 00:44:25.329
What?

725
00:44:30.134 --> 00:44:33.103
You old fuckin' Jew.
Here's my share.

726
00:44:33.170 --> 00:44:34.838
Think I'm gonna
profit off of your tax?

727
00:44:39.243 --> 00:44:40.677
Never entered my mind.

728
00:45:01.065 --> 00:45:04.034
Dr. Melfi. There's
nothin' there. you know.

729
00:45:04.101 --> 00:45:06.303
You don't have
to explain nothin'. Tony.

730
00:45:09.406 --> 00:45:11.675
This psychiatry shit.

731
00:45:11.742 --> 00:45:14.411
apparently. what you're feelin'
is not what you're feelin'.

732
00:45:14.478 --> 00:45:17.314
