733
00:45:31.128 --> 00:45:33.163
You're gonna stick
with it. right?

734
00:45:33.230 --> 00:45:37.000
- I don't know.
- I think you should.

735
00:45:37.067 --> 00:45:39.336
- You do?
- Uh-huh.

736
00:45:42.306 --> 00:45:43.974
I was jealous.

737
00:45:44.041 --> 00:45:46.610
- I should've told you...
- No. wait. Let me finish. Tony.

738
00:45:49.346 --> 00:45:51.215
I've been thinki"
a lot about this.

739
00:45:54.485 --> 00:45:57.054
I was jealous of her
ability to help you...

740
00:45:58.188 --> 00:46:00.657
to be a sort
of salvation to you.

741
00:46:01.725 --> 00:46:03.293
I talked to Father Phil. and...

742
