744
00:46:19.309 --> 00:46:20.577
You are my life.

745
00:46:25.315 --> 00:46:26.416
Come here.

746
00:46:45.302 --> 00:46:46.904
Okay. I'm no good at speeches.

747
00:46:46.970 --> 00:46:50.107
Yeah. you owe him
a fuckin' dime. you'll
