748
00:46:50.174 --> 00:46:53.343
Shut up. Your Honor.
Let me talk.

749
00:46:53.410 --> 00:46:55.245
Go ahead. talk.
I was only kiddin'. Go ahead.

750
00:46:55.312 --> 00:46:58.582
All right. I'd like everybody
to raise their glasses.

751
00:47:08.625 --> 00:47:09.760
Okay...

752
00:47:11.461 --> 00:47:13.664
He taught me as much as anybody.

753
00:47:13.730 --> 00:47:15.566
except for maybe my father.

754
00:47:17.801 --> 00:47:20.571
Even if he wasn't my uncle.

755
00:47:20.637 --> 00:47:23.740
<i>I'd be standin' here sayin'.</i>

